{"sha": "0d8e1848391bc2174e7be916797a4b3572147f9e6e0f5b6ba35941804c1b6acd", "body": ["\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g11:trigo:solve}", "求 $\\cos t = \\frac12$ 在 $\\intoc{-\\pi}{\\pi}$ 上的解。$\\cos a = \\frac12$ 的一个解为", "$a = \\frac{\\pi}{3}$。通解为", "$t = \\frac\\pi3 + 2k\\pi$ 和 $t = -\\frac\\pi3 + 2k\\pi$。在", "$\\intoc{-\\pi}{\\pi}$ 内，只有 $k = 0$ 时的解落在其中：", "$t \\in \\left\\{-\\frac\\pi3,\\ \\frac\\pi3\\right\\}$。", "", "求 $\\sin t = -\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}$ 在 $\\intco{0}{2\\pi}$ 上的解。一个角为", "$a = -\\frac\\pi4$，解为 $t = -\\frac\\pi4 + 2k\\pi$ 和", "$t = \\pi + \\frac\\pi4 + 2k\\pi = \\frac{5\\pi}{4} + 2k\\pi$。在", "$\\intco{0}{2\\pi}$ 内：$t = \\frac{7\\pi}{4}$（由 $k = 1$ 得到）和", "$t = \\frac{5\\pi}{4}$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=2.0]", "  \\draw[->] (-1.35,0) -- (1.45,0) node[right] {$x$};", "  \\draw[->] (0,-1.2) -- (0,1.3) node[above] {$y$};", "  \\draw[gray] (0,0) circle (1);", "  \\draw[omProp, thick] (0.5,-1.05) -- (0.5,1.15)", "    node[above, font=\\small] {$x = \\tfrac12$};", "  \\fill (60:1) circle (0.7pt)", "    node[above right, font=\\small] {$M\\!\\left(\\tfrac\\pi3\\right)$};", "  \\fill (-60:1) circle (0.7pt)", "    node[below right, font=\\small] {$M\\!\\left(-\\tfrac\\pi3\\right)$};", "  \\draw[omDef, thin] (0,0) -- (60:1);", "  \\draw[omDef, thin] (0,0) -- (-60:1);", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 求解 $\\cos t = \\frac12$：竖直线 $x = \\frac12$", "（橙色）与单位圆交于两点，这两点关于 $x$ 轴对称", "--- 因此得到两族解 $t = \\pm\\frac\\pi3 + 2k\\pi$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g11:trigo:1}", "将下列角度换算为弧度：$30^\\circ$、$45^\\circ$、$120^\\circ$、$270^\\circ$。", "将下列弧度换算为度数：$\\frac{\\pi}{5}$、$\\frac{5\\pi}{6}$、$\\frac{7\\pi}{4}$、", "$\\frac{2\\pi}{9}$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g11:trigo:2}", "在单位圆上标出点 $M(t)$，其中", "\\[", "t = \\frac{2\\pi}{3},\\quad", "t = -\\frac{\\pi}{4},\\quad", "t = \\frac{17\\pi}{6},\\quad", "t = -\\frac{7\\pi}{2},", "\\]", "先将每个值化为 $\\intoc{-\\pi}{\\pi}$ 内的值（模 $2\\pi$）。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g11:trigo:3}", "利用表格及诱导公式，求下列各式的精确值：", "\\[", "\\cos\\frac{3\\pi}{4}, \\quad", "\\sin\\frac{5\\pi}{6}, \\quad", "\\cos\\left(-\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right), \\quad", "\\sin\\frac{4\\pi}{3}, \\quad", "\\cos\\frac{11\\pi}{6} .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g11:trigo:4}", "已知 $\\cos t = \\frac{5}{13}$，且 $t \\in \\intoo{-\\frac\\pi2}{0}$，求", "$\\sin t$ 的精确值。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g11:trigo:5}", "对任意实数 $x$，化简：", "\\[", "A = \\cos(\\pi + x) + \\cos(-x) + \\sin\\left(\\frac\\pi2 - x\\right) - \\cos x,", "\\qquad", "B = \\sin(\\pi - x) + \\sin(\\pi + x) + \\sin(-x) .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g11:trigo:6}", "在 $\\intoc{-\\pi}{\\pi}$ 上解下列方程：", "\\[", "\\cos t = \\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}, \\qquad", "\\sin t = \\frac12, \\qquad", "\\cos t = -1 .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g11:trigo:7}", "在 $\\intco{0}{2\\pi}$ 上解下列方程：", "\\[", "\\sin t = -\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}, \\qquad", "\\cos t = 0, \\qquad", "2\\sin t + 1 = 0 .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g11:trigo:8}", "在 $\\R$ 上解方程 $\\cos 2t = \\cos t$。（利用", "\\cref{thm:g11:trigo:equations}，取 $a = t$，并讨论两族", "解的情况。）", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g11:trigo:9}", "证明：对所有实数 $x$，有", "\\[", "\\bigl(\\cos x + \\sin x\\bigr)^2 + \\bigl(\\cos x - \\sin x\\bigr)^2 = 2 .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g11:trigo:10}", "一个半径为 $30$ cm 的车轮做无滑动滚动。自行车前进 $1.5$ m 时，车轮转过的角度", "（分别以弧度和度为单位）是多少？", "车轮转动一整圈时，自行车前进多远？", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}